WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.940
Oh, did you buy a Buitton bag?

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.690
Yes. I found the one
that I wanted.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.160
What about your Shanel watch?

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.720
I'm going to get it
for my birthday.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:00.830
That's great!

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.110
<i>It's been three months.</i>

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:17.320
<i>Domyoji and Shigeru haven't
come back to school.</i>

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:42.340
"Neverending"

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.570
"The sea sparkles at our feet.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.140
"With not a cloud in the sky...

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.760
"...the spring sun shines
upon the vast sea...

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.330
"...and soon a curtain falls
to the depths of the waves...

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.830
"...giving them
deepening warmth."

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.740
What, another one?
What about your other girls?

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.850
Ah, I know how to handle them.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.120
By the way, how's your Madame?

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:32.360
Everything's under control.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:39.430
<i>The F4 are down
to only Mimasaka and Nishikado...</i>

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.640
<i>since Rui Hanazawa returned to Paris
to be with Shizuka.</i>

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:57.220
<i>Lately, I see Kazuya and
Sakurako together a lot.</i>

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.880
I don't know if I can...

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.220
Of course you can!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.060
I know you can do it!

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.990
But, still...

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.960
<i>They seem to get along well.</i>

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.580
We've got to
put a stop to it now!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:17.240
She attracts too much attention
for a commoner!

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.710
Here she comes.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.780
Listen, you! Wait a second...

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:28.780
<i>Asai's bunch found
someone else to bully.</i>

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:33.420
A low-down commoner like you
has no business being here.

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.050
Do you understand?

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.120
Sengoku-ya

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.100
<i>I got a 50-yen raise
at my part-time job.</i>

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.870
Three yukizakura
and four daifuku?

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.130
One moment, please.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.470
<i>Yuki calls it a miracle.</i>

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.610
Tsukushi.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.380
Yes?

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.050
A package came for you.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:05.480
Oh, thank you!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.890
<i>Something from the folks
in the country.</i>

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.800
To Tsukushi

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.060
<i>They've all adapted well
to country life.</i>

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:28.660
<i>This morning, I got a letter
from Hiruta, from the next class over.</i>

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.360
And what I told you the other...

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.340
Is that him?

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:43.510
Yeah...

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.080
He's blushing.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.310
Cut it out!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:51.180
What are you going to do,
Tsukushi?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.020
I don't know...

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.930
<i>I'm considering
going out with him.</i>

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.130
Hm...

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.470
What is it?

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.800
Oh, nothing...

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.200
I brought spring rolls, today.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.400
I have rice with seaweed...
and grilled fish.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.280
Really?

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.690
My folks sent them to me
from the country.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.410
Oh, how nice.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.650
<i>My days have been uneventful,
but peaceful.</i>

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.890
<i>This is the life
I've been waiting for.</i>

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.160
Awful news!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.500
What are you so excited about?

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:50.880
They say Domyoji and Shigeru Okawahara
are getting married!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.050
No way!
But they're still in high school!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.880
Is that legal?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.180
Both families want it done
as soon as possible.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:04.970
And their honeymoon will be
a world cruise on a luxury liner!

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.720
How fabulous!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.860
Leave it to the Domyojis to plan
something so spectacular.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:35.280
<i>Today, the whole school is sending
the honeymooners off.</i>

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:39.620
Here they come!

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:12.520
Shigeru! You look fabulous!

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.180
<i>Tsukasa...</i>

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.450
Congratulations!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:56.860
Congratulations!
I wish you every happiness!

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:12.130
Domyoji!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.460
You look wonderful!

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.050
Please turn this way!

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:17.520
Here it comes!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:22.750
Catch!

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.110
Makino...

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:55.390
Miss Urara...

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.460
I have something for you.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:03.930
It's from Domyoji.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.160
From Domyoji?

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.080
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.950
Well, I've done my part.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.070
What's with Makino?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.010
Tsukushi! What's wrong?

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.650
I have to get to Domyoji.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.710
They've removed the ramp.

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.690
Move! Move!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.850
<i>Makino...
When I get on this ship...</i>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.930
I'm going to find an interesting country
and disappear.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.060
Of course, I'm getting out
of this marriage.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.670
Oh! Makino!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:55.070
<i>The monkey-girl can find a man anytime,
so I won't worry about her.</i>

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.700
<i>I plan to come back
when things cool down.</i>

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:01.550
<i>Take care, until then. So long.</i>

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:17.700
Tsukushi?!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:22.930
Makino!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.660
Tsukushi...

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:50.860
What a fool!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:54.870
<i>How dare he...!</i>

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.810
Hey, are you all right?

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.350
<i>I won't let him!</i>

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:21.130
Tsukasa... Domyoji!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.030
M-Makino!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.030
You irresponsible, good-for-nothing...!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.510
W-what are you doing?!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.700
You should know!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.480
I can't believe
you're such a complete jerk!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.780
Shigeru... What about Shigeru?!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:47.150
What are you talking about?
You must be crazy!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:50.160
You're the one who's crazy!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.160
Hurray!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.460
Tsukushi's angry!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.590
I did a great bit of acting,
if I do say so myself.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.830
It made it worth my while
to transfer schools.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:03.470
Huh?

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.560
Since Tsukasa turned me down...

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.610
I felt I had to
get you two together.

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.710
I went through
so much trouble...

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.380
Don't tell me... this wedding...

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:22.720
Of course! It's to outsmart
Tsukasa's mom!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.260
What's going on?

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:29.190
Why did Makino get on the ship?

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.000
Nishida, get me
the captain on the ship.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.640
Mother! Please try to understand!
Tsukasa is...

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.690
Tsukasa was so shocked
at being rejected by you...

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.440
that he became
his mother's puppet.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:49.310
So, I got some friends together
to put on a show.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:50.580
That letter...

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.050
Rui thought it was the only way
to get you angry,

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.650
so he copied Tsukasa's scrawl.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.760
So Miss Urara was in on it too?

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.930
That's right.
And a host of other actors.

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.260
It's time.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:12.400
S-Shigeru...

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:13.640
So long!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.640
Shigeru!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.350
Shigeru!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:27.490
God will surely forgive us
for a trick like this!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.160
Kazuya...

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.030
Sojiro! Akira! You...!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.560
Be happy!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.570
Be happy!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.610
W-we're moving! This isn't funny!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.950
Let go of me, Domyoji!
I won't be able to go back!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:21.640
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.310
Mother, please let them go!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.620
Captain?

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.960
This is Kaede Domyoji.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.030
I leave Tsukasa...

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:43.760
I leave my son and his companion
in your care.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:45.530
Good-bye...

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:51.870
Mother!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:03.310
It's already started... Our next story...

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.590
Domyoji...

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.610
Bye-bye!

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:33.610
Will this really smooth things out
between them?

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:37.420
Makino might try
jumping off the ship.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.930
She just might...

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.620
It all depends on Tsukasa now.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:38.810
Where the heck
is this ship going, anyway?!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.550
Where do you think, silly?
Around the world, of course!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.780
Wait just a darn minute!

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:04.780
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:09.530
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:19.000
Some day, the whole world

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:24.810
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:32.560
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:38.180
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:44.800
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:51.200
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:58.100
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:06.980
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:14.890
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:20.950
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:28.210
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:31.600
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:37.470
I already made it this far, after all.
